              "text": {
                "en": "In the plural, the -d of the stem comes back: `nous attendons`, `vous vendez`, `ils répondent`.\n\nThe past participle of these verbs ends in **-u**: `attendu`, `vendu`, `répondu`, `entendu`, `perdu`.\n\n- `nous attendons` but `j'attends`\n- `ils perdent` but `perdu`",
